## SQ-CWG-06 | fresh world: locates resolve, /celocate status, a punch meta structure places, earth fill logs, dimensions
@group A
@commands Fresh world: `/locate structure` three pack structures, `/cwglocate status`; `/place structure creativeengineering:meta/meteorite_desert_pyramid` (a meta structure with a punch part); grep latest.log for `meteorite_desert_pyramid` and `unknown field`; `/tp` to a village and read the earth fill log lines
