@fails `punch` missing from `META_PART_KEYS` in the Worldgen jar's `structure_overrides.js` (fixed 2026-11-03, rebuild Creative Worldgen), registration not moved to `CreativeWorldgen`, or the `meta_punch` piece type id changed
